<title>HONG KONG: China Pharma interim net rises 70.43 pct.</title>
<headline>China Pharma interim net rises 70.43 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   3.42   vs 2.01</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    1.2    vs 1.4</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil    vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    20.53  vs 12.05</p>
<p>    Turnover		     126.58 vs 59.27</p>
<p>    Company name		 China Pharmaceutical Enterprise</p>
<p>and Investment Corp Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  October 22-25</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   November 15</p>
<p>NOTE - China Pharmaceutical Enterprise is a China-backed Vitamin C maker.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
